#: polyhost/services/game_assets/generals/__init__.py:14
msgid "The Command & Conquer Generals or Zero Hour install folder, the one that holds Game.dat and EnglishZH.big (or the archive of another language). The overlay then shows the hotkeys of the installed language and of the player's own CommandMap.ini. Empty: the folder of the running game and the usual install folders on Windows, in Steam and under Wine are searched."
msgstr "A pasta de instalação do Command & Conquer Generals ou Zero Hour, a que contém Game.dat e EnglishZH.big (ou o arquivo de outro idioma). A sobreposição mostra então os atalhos do idioma instalado e do CommandMap.ini do próprio jogador. Vazio: a pasta do jogo em execução e as pastas de instalação habituais no Windows, no Steam e no Wine são pesquisadas."

